    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Human.</strong> Normalized BBTTCC ancestry root.</p><p>Select one heritage separately when building the character: <strong>Erectus, Florensis, Neanderthal</strong>.</p><p>This root grants the shared Human core trait package and preserves live UUID compatibility for existing feature items.</p><p><em>\u201cHumanity is not special. It\u2019s just stubborn enough to keep moving when reality begs it to stop.\u201d</em></p>\n<p><strong>Adaptive.</strong> Once per long rest, when you fail a saving throw, you can choose to succeed instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Tenacious.</strong> While you have 1 hit point, you have advantage on one check of your choice each round (declare before rolling).</p>\n<p><strong>Lineage Memory.</strong> Choose one human lineage (Neanderthal, Denisovan, Florensis, Erectus). Your lineage grants Tier powers as you level.</p>",
